8219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-18T14:11:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T14:51:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122543","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122543.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122543.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #119288\r\n\r\nFixes missing completion for recursive chains of Inheritance / Inner Classes\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nImplements similar recursive approaches for multiple completion context paths leading to the following methods:\r\n\r\n1. `_list_available_types`: Create a recursive helper `_add_type_members` which calls itself for both parent and outer classes. Was only outer classes and initial classes parents beforehand.\r\n2. `_find_identifiers_in_class`: Move inheritance checking into the outer class loop to actually check all parents as well. (Specific problem described in #119288)\r\n3. `_guess_identifier_type_from_base`: Move part of the logic out to a `_guess_identifier_from_class` method, mirroring the existing approach from `_find_identifiers_in_class`/`_base`, and add outer class checking. Was only inheritance before.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Verification</summary>\r\nNote the now shown `InnerClassA2` / `InnerClassA3`\r\n\r\n| Method | Before | After |\r\n|---|--------|-------|\r\n| 1 | <img width=\"473\" height=\"337\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40a56243-8dba-4f96-b546-8d2e9c4db0f9\" /> | <img width=\"538\" height=\"374\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a7ea763-0463-4bc1-b541-1091c883aad4\" /> |\r\n| 2 | <img width=\"476\" height=\"344\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/233595c4-0aa0-4840-bb85-9c9728344147\" /> | <img width=\"461\" height=\"362\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/832e9887-983c-4d1a-a06c-ef5a52962e19\" /> |\r\n| 3 | <img width=\"477\" height=\"346\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bacb46aa-76c0-45ed-8a94-ae40e1b3d707\" /> | <img width=\"458\" height=\"370\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf2c60cd-f81b-42a2-8178-d4a501373b6f\" /> |\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nMost of the changes is actually just moving existing logic, I hope that it is reviewable still. I might have missed a scenario thats still missing this fix. Also there might be potential for a more unified approach to this kind of tree-walking as suggested by existing comments, but I didn't find a convincing ssolution.\r\n\r\nAlso about the Recursion Limit Checking, there are two approaches present in the file, so I just used the less intrusive one (for which I had to move up its declaration), but I'm open to doing it differently.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122543/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}